      "product_intro_v2_mcmr7P": {
        "type": "product-intro-v2",
        "blocks": {
          "tab_MBEqta": {
            "type": "tab",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Melatonin Gummies",
              "content": "<p>A gummy has to survive your entire digestive system before it can do anything. Stomach acid, liver processing, 45+ minutes of waiting — and by the time it reaches your bloodstream, up to 80% of the active ingredients are gone. You're paying for 100% and absorbing 20%.</p>",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/melatonin_gummy_comparison.webp",
              "hide_image_bg": true,
              "full_width_image": true,
              "badge_text": "",
              "badge_position_desktop": "bottom-right",
              "badge_position_mobile": "top-left"
            }
          },
          "tab_iLBcRm": {
            "type": "tab",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Sleeping Pills",
              "content": "<p>Sleeping pills are dosed high on purpose — the manufacturers know most of it won't survive your stomach. So you overdose to get a fraction of the effect, and your body spends the next morning processing the rest. That's the grogginess. It's not you, it's the delivery method.</p>",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/sleeping_pill_comparison.webp",
              "hide_image_bg": true,
              "full_width_image": true,
              "badge_text": "",
              "badge_position_desktop": "top-right",
              "badge_position_mobile": "top-right"
            }
          },
          "tab_TfaWen": {
            "type": "tab",
            "settings": {
              "title": "Natural Remedies",
              "content": "<p>The ingredients are real — the doses aren't. Too small, absorbed too slowly to actually shift your sleep. You feel calmer for 20 minutes, then you're staring at the ceiling at 2 a.m. wondering why \"natural\" never works.</p>",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/natural_products_comparison.webp",
              "hide_image_bg": true,
              "full_width_image": true,
              "badge_text": "",
              "badge_icon": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_4.svg",
              "badge_position_desktop": "bottom-left",
              "badge_position_mobile": "top-right"
            }
          }
        },
        "block_order": [
          "tab_MBEqta",
          "tab_iLBcRm",
          "tab_TfaWen"
        ],
        "name": "Product Intro V2",
        "settings": {
          "heading": "<p>You've tried everything, yet <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>nothing stuck</em></span></p>",
          "description": "<p>And we're not surprised. Every gummy and pill loses up to 50% its efficacy in your digestive system before it ever reaches your bloodstream. Rejuvia, though, absorbs directly under your tongue — so the ingredients kick in on arrival.</p>",
          "accent_color": "#672666"
        }
      },
      "listicle_v2_N8G8nM": {
        "type": "listicle-v2",
        "name": "Listicle V2",
        "settings": {
          "heading": "<p>The real issue isn't what you took — it's how your body <em>absorbed it</em></p>",
          "description": "<p>Every pill, capsule, and gummy has to survive your stomach — acid, enzymes, your liver — before anything reaches your bloodstream. Most of it doesn't make it.</p><p>A 5mg melatonin gummy might deliver 1mg to where it's actually needed. <strong>It's not a bad product — it's a bad absorption mechanism.</strong></p><p>Rejuvia skips all of that. A spray under your tongue absorbs straight into your bloodstream — no stomach, no waiting, no waste.</p>",
          "graph_image": "shopify://shop_images/rejuvia_absorption_graph.webp"
        }
      },
