              "title": "Rejuvia is the real deal!! Great family owned business",
              "text": "I was skeptical when I purchased this sleep spray for a friend who cannot sleep through the night. I also purchased one for myself to try it. To my surprise, it works! I sleep soundly for 6-7 hours and do not wake up groggy. I recommend this sleep spray.",
