          "headline": "Rejuvia was originally for my mom - now it's for everyone",
          "paragraph_1": "My mom was 55, going through menopause and a whole lot of stress, and couldn't sleep. She'd tried everything and nothing helped. So at the University of Pennsylvania I built her an oral sleep spray with 13 natural sleep ingredients that absorbs under your tongue and works in minutes, not hours.",
